---
// [DEMO-MARKET-1 2026-08-26] Public marketplace — currently the DESIGN COMP.
//
// Owner decision: the Marketplace entry in the header menu and the footer must
// land on the new bazaar mockup. Both already point at /marketplace, and a dozen
// other links do too (hero CTAs, the 25 category tiles, "Explore Marketplace",
// "See who's live"), so this route serves the comp rather than every one of
// those links being repointed at a preview URL and later repointed back.
//
// WHAT THIS REPLACED, AND HOW TO PUT IT BACK
//   This page used to render <MarketplaceBrowse hrefBase="" .../> inside Base,
//   with <AuthRedirect/> sending signed-in visitors to /dashboard/marketplace.
//   That component is untouched and still live at /dashboard/marketplace, so
//   restoring the real page is `git show <this commit>^:web/src/pages/marketplace.astro`
//   — nothing was deleted.
//
//   Worth knowing while the comp is up: the real browse grid renders from
//   GET /api/explore, which returns zero listings in production today
//   ({"vertical":"commerce","listings":[],"cursor":null}), so the page it
//   replaces currently shows "Nothing here yet".
//
// The comp runs on hardcoded mock data and cannot be searched, filtered or
// booked for real. Its cards link to /<creator>/<listing>, which serves the
// listing-details comp — see pages/[username]/[slug].astro.
export const prerender = false;

import { renderMockupPage } from '../lib/mockupPage';
// Staged into web/src/generated/ by prebuild; see scripts/copy-design-demo.mjs
// for why it is generated rather than committed, and why it is not in public/.
import mockupHtml from '../generated/marketplace.dc.html?raw';

return renderMockupPage({
  html: mockupHtml,
  title: 'Marketplace · avaTOK',
  // Every card in the comp shares one handler, so they all land on the same demo
  // listing — the comp carries no per-card id to build a real URL from. Passing
  // a real id is the first piece of the backend work, not a bug.
  //
  // FULLY ABSOLUTE, on purpose. <base href="https://avatok-design.pages.dev/">
  // rebases root-relative URLs too, not just bare filenames — a plain
  // '/avatok/mock-listing' navigates to avatok-design.pages.dev/avatok/mock-listing
  // and dumps the visitor on the preview site's index.
  listingHref: new URL('/avatok/mock-listing', Astro.url).href,
});
---
